  "notes": "Both envs rebuilt with Python 3.12, installing resiliparse 0.17.2 from the wheel URL in uv.lock (its own index has no upload dates, so the date cutoff dropped it); chex added to both. The workload runs marin tokenize() end to end (TokenizeConfig with train and validation splits of local gz jsonl files, a locally trained BPE tokenizer, small window_size_bytes) through Zephyr's local backend, then hashes the levanter cache contents. Zephyr scratch storage is kept local by setting MARIN_PREFIX to a local dir and http_proxy to a dead local port so the GCP metadata region lookup fails. Coverage: head 29/31 changed lines, base 12/14. Outputs are equal on both sides and the no-network run passes. Base run time is about 16s, over the 10s target but under the 30s hard limit; about 6.4s of that is imports and most of the rest is fixed pipeline startup."
